# Copy this file to `.env` (gitignored, never commit real keys) and fill in real values.
# Loaded by docker-compose.yml's `api` service via `env_file: .env`.
#
# Real AI provider API keys, forwarded per-request to the self-hosted Portkey OSS gateway
# (Story 1.4/AD-14) -- one AIGATEWAY__PROVIDERAPIKEYS__<PROVIDER> line per provider that's
# actually assigned to an AI task (see Admin -> AI Configuration in the app). The <PROVIDER>
# segment is matched case-insensitively against the provider name shown there (e.g. "Groq"),
# so exact casing here doesn't matter -- shown here in UPPER_SNAKE_CASE purely by .env convention.
AIGATEWAY__PROVIDERAPIKEYS__GROQ=
